  m_Name: A14_X1_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I think back to one of my training days with Aleph, where I told him that
      my favourite food my mother used to make me was spaghetti and meatballs.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s just such a classic."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I could eat it every day, but when I attempt to make it something always
      seems missing and I end up a little disappointed.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Nobody has ever made it as good as mom used to.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 17259816d083dbf418fb2fd14b1f2374, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5085b980366a0af4ab24ef29fc94636f, type: 2}
